  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_019) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.638999). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a more sophisticated encoder) could further improve performance, while keeping other components (image encoder, aggregation, fusion) consistent. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, a critical design choice, and builds on the promising direction of multiprofile and weighted fusion."
